00:01:24.425 --> 00:01:25.292
(laughs)

00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:27.596
(upbeat music)

00:01:27.596 --> 00:01:28.429
- Dang!

00:01:28.429 --> 00:01:30.917
This one's so pretty, I
don't wanna mess it up.

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:34.149
- I feel like I am sitting
